EU foreign ministers are currently meeting in Luxembourg to reassess migration cooperation with North African nations 🇪🇺. The focus is on adjusting current frameworks to manage rising Mediterranean arrivals. Funding and border management will be central topics of discussion, aiming for a unified approach 🌊. Officials are hoping to finalize a plan by day’s end. 
#EUmigration #NorthAfrica
